OL,3,GNEWSAForce downgraded over victim
OL,4,Asafety failings
OL,5,
OL,6,FPublic safety is being put at risk due
OL,7,Fto Devon and Cornwall Police's failure
OL,8,Fto investigate crime and protect
OL,9,Fvictims, inspectors have said.
OL,11,FHis Majesty's Inspectorate of
OL,12,FConstabulary and Fire & Rescue Services
OL,13,F(HMICFRS) said the force had been
OL,14,Fdowngraded from Level Two to Level
OL,15,FThree because its performance had
OL,16,Fdeteriorated this year.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
