OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAForce downgraded over victim
OL,4,Asafety failings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move comes just two months after
OL,7,Finspectors placed the force in Level
OL,8,FTwo, saying it needed enhanced support
OL,9,Fbecause of concerns about its handling
OL,10,Fof investigations and its ability to
OL,11,Fsafeguard vulnerable adults and
OL,12,Fchildren.
OL,14,FChief constable James Vaughan accepted
OL,15,Fthat the public "deserve a better
OL,16,Fservice and a stronger leadership
OL,17,Fresponse".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
